  "identifier": "monai-model-zoo",
  "name": "MONAI Model Zoo",
  "alternateName": ["Project-MONAI Model Zoo", "MONAI Bundle Zoo"],
  "description": "Curated repository of 30+ production-ready medical imaging models in standardised MONAI Bundle format, covering segmentation, detection, classification, and image synthesis across CT, MRI, pathology, and endoscopy modalities. Bundles include model weights, training configs, inference scripts, and metadata. Hosted on GitHub, NVIDIA NGC, and Hugging Face.",
