  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The most comprehensive open-source collection of production-ready medical imaging models. 30+ models in a standardised Bundle format (weights + configs + inference scripts) spanning CT, MRI, pathology, and endoscopy. Apache-2.0, highly active (315 stars, regular releases), distributed via GitHub, NVIDIA NGC, and Hugging Face. MONAI Bundle format enables reproducible deployment but lacks alignment with open metadata standards (no MLDCAT-AP, Croissant, or CodeMeta) — MACH partially fills that gap by providing standards-aligned metadata for individual zoo entries.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-12",

